      "trackName": "Mini Battleship Watch Game",
      "description": "Mini Battleship Watch Game is a fast naval strategy game \n\nSet up your fleet, rotate and position ships, and fire at the enemy grid turn by turn. Use smart tactics, read your opponent’s pattern, and choose the right shot at the right time.\n\nFeatures:\n• Drag-and-drop ship placement\n• Rotate, shuffle, and quick start controls\n• Turn-based tactical gameplay\n• Smart AI opponent\n• Special and standard shot system\n• Clean interface optimized for watch screens\n\nPlay anytime in short sessions. No account required",
